<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17102" root="روف" body-key="r">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَافَ</span></b> , (IDrd, K,) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَرَافُ</span>, (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَرُوفُ</span>,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَوْفٌ</span>, (IDrd,) is a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأَفَ</span>, (IDrd,
K,) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَرْأَفُ</span>: (K:) or, as some say, (IDrd,)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَوْفٌ</span> signifies The <i>being still;</i> and is not from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّأْفَةُ</span>: (IDrd, K:) [ISd says,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَافَ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَوْفٌ</span>,
signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَكَنَ</span> [<i>he,</i> or <i>it, was,</i> or <i>became, still,</i>
&amp;c.] and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأَفَ</span> [q. v.] is a dial. var. thereof [signifying thus]; and is not from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَؤُوفٌ</span> syn. with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحِيمٌ</span>. (M.)

